    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Your library lives only on this device. Nothing is uploaded unless you use AI chat. Each request then carries your message, an outline of your library (titles, how they nest, and each post\'s learning status — no post content), and the text of any note the assistant asks to read. Chat history is never included in exports. The DeepSeek API key stays on your backend, never in this app.</string>
